                        "entry_id": "494b55a9-c509-3134-bf6f-d31f9a100c48",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Characterised or marked by queerness; peculiar; odd"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "85828008-ddad-4e40-9e66-717d9adfc94c",
                                "sense_id": "e58bcad6-48a3-35be-a16d-c4afad9d9eb3",
                                "text": "“A queersome breed of spiritualist, to my way of thinking, young man. One who summons communication from the dead, who make knocking sounds from the world beyond.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "908a9dd5-c7d2-4365-92bf-b7249514b30b",
                                "sense_id": "e58bcad6-48a3-35be-a16d-c4afad9d9eb3",
                                "text": "“Oh, one more thing, sir, I found this queersome. She said Lieutenant Mull sent her? I don't understand it though. He's not due from Virginia for another fortnight.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "58e1b20a-3a4d-45b6-9ad1-f103c59e94d7",
                                "sense_id": "e58bcad6-48a3-35be-a16d-c4afad9d9eb3",
                                "text": "Then we would rise to see his eyes crooked with a queersome madness and his fingers still aflitter."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "876ca4d5-a0ba-4108-919b-9a0b8d4e87ae",
                                "sense_id": "e58bcad6-48a3-35be-a16d-c4afad9d9eb3",
                                "text": "A great victory is made and, with it, a devastating loss. We, Stonewall's Brigade, must now follow another. Our commander, queersome yet brilliant, has died, shot by his own men as he audaciously sought to continue battle under a full moon."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
